---

SPIRIT OF THIS LICENSE

MAC was built because students at MBM University deserved access to the same
AI tools that well-funded institutions take for granted — without relying on
proprietary cloud services, without monthly fees, and without their academic
work being used to train someone else's model.

We release it openly because we believe every college in India (and beyond)
should be able to run their own AI infrastructure. Fork it, adapt it, make
it better — just keep it open, keep it educational, and give credit where
it's due.

— MBM University CSE Department, Jodhpur
